Begin Actor Class=LevelDesignerNotification Name=LevelDesignerNotification1
    readMe="This map is at its BSP limits. Rebuilding will cause the BSP tree to freak. If you want to add more detail without issue, consider deleting the complex underwater semi-solid brushes. Pathnode count is also just under 1000., which appears to be the limit. if you absolutely must add geometry to add geometry-based decoration without simplifying, use movers with bHighlight and bFrobbable disabled, but not too many as there's a limit in that regard too. It's best to focus on using meshes, decals and effects though. P.S there won't be many of these notifications about. Only with experience and trial and error will you be able to make quality level design additions. Start with an experiment by making your own level from scratch, solely to gain experience."
